<title>UK: Anglo-American reports higher earnings.</title>
<headline>Anglo-American reports higher earnings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-American Corp of South Africa Ltd on Tuesday reported full-year headline earnings of 5.015 billion rand, up from 4.077 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>For a full results table, see Reuter Johannesburg story headlined &quot;Anglo year earnings up 23 pct&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
